<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108401" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθάλπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heat inwardly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό μ᾽ αὖ . . μανίαι θάλπουσ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					878
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τινὰ τέχνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.34
				</span></i>
			; <i>warm up,</i> in literal sense, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Sat.Gon.</u>
				22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>light</i> or <i>kindle secretly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίδα τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					306
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>glow under,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέφρη</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρπάζουσα</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> πῦρ ὑποθαλπόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.92
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>).</div>
